Unicode Han Database (Unihan) — traditional-to-simplified table
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The binary contains a table of traditional and simplified Chinese character
pairs derived from the Unicode Han Database (Unihan) 18.0.0, file
Unihan_Variants.txt, field kSimplifiedVariant — https://www.unicode.org/
(see https://www.unicode.org/terms_of_use.html). It is used to cut Chinese text
into words for tags and to let the two scripts meet in keyword search.

